# 1. Pisahkan 4 hal yang sering tercampur

Sebelum bicara file, kita kunci dulu definisinya:

```text
MGBOS
= Business Operating System
= fakta, transaksi, workflow, rules, database

JARVIS
= Intelligence & Management Layer
= memahami kondisi, merencanakan, mengawasi, mengingatkan

AGENT
= Digital role / specialist
= CFO, COO, CMO, Sales, Content, Procurement, dll.

SKILL
= kemampuan reusable
= analyze_cashflow()
= qualify_lead()
= create_content_plan()
= compare_vendor()

TOOL
= capability ke dunia luar
= baca database
= kirim WhatsApp
= publish content
= create invoice
= baca marketplace
```

Sehingga:

```text
RIZKY
   ↓
JARVIS
   ↓
AGENTS
   ↓
SKILLS
   ↓
TOOLS
   ↓
MGBOS / EXTERNAL SYSTEMS
```

Ini harus menjadi model canonical kita.

