# Architectural Laws-nya juga sudah kuat

Menurut gue 10 hukum ini kita pertahankan hampir apa adanya:

```text
1. Authoritative facts live outside the LLM.

2. Agents never gain authority merely
   because they can reason about a task.

3. Every external mutation has
   an explicit tool contract.

4. High-risk actions require stronger
   permission and evidence.

5. Memory is context,
   not transactional truth.

6. Business invariants remain inside
   authoritative business systems.

7. Tool execution must be observable
   and verifiable.

8. Provider implementation
   must be replaceable.

9. Autonomy is earned capability-by-capability,
   not granted globally.

10. When state is uncertain,
    JARVIS reports uncertainty
    instead of inventing success.
```

Ini sudah hampir seperti **JARVIS Constitution**.

